            <description><![CDATA[<p>Lodge 1.0</p><ul><li>A thank-you screen now confirms your license after you activate it.</li><li>Clearer screens when Lodge can&#39;t confirm your license or read the Keychain, with a way to try again.</li><li>Safer copying: files are checked after copying, and the history of what was copied is better protected.</li><li>The Tip Jar is now in the Lodge and Help menus and in Settings.</li><li>Updates and downloads now come from dl.bashfra.me.</li></ul>]]></description>
